    "ampWorkspaceId": "ws-00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
    "idcIdentityStoreId": "d-1234567890",
    "idcRegion": "us-east-1",
    "_idcAssumeRoleArn_help": "跨账号: IdC 在 org 管理账号、应用部署在另一个账号时, 填管理账号一个只读角色 ARN (信任本 platform-api-role, 权限 identitystore:GetUserId+DescribeUser, 见 docs/identity-center-cognito-configuration.md). 后端先 AssumeRole 再查 IdC. 同账号留空. idcIdentityStoreId/idcRegion 仍要填管理账号那个 store 的值.",
    "idcAssumeRoleArn": "",
